<SiteLayout title="Privacy — Friendlabs" description="Privacy policies for Friendlabs apps and website.">
<section class="page">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 30 October 2026</p>

      <p>Each Friendlabs app has its own privacy policy, published on this site before the app is released. Policies for individual apps will be listed below.</p>

      <h2>App policies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/privacy/hratkov/">Hrátkov (kids games)</a> - local child settings; subscription verification with RevenueCat; no ads</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>We do not add analytics, advertising trackers, or advertising cookies to this website. Images and fonts are served from this site. Our hosting provider, Vercel, processes technical request information to deliver and secure the website. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel’s privacy policy</a>. If you contact us by email, we use your address and message to reply.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy? Contact us via the <a href="/support/">support page</a>.</p>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
